        <item>
            <title>1.0.33</title>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h2>What's new in 1.0.33</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li><b>Your message is just what you said</b> — Hush no longer adds a note about which screenshot you circled into the chat, so Berries Code stops showing words you never spoke. The same information now rides in the hidden instructions instead.</li>
                    <li>Pair this with Berries Code 1.6.38, which answers straight from the screenshot instead of reading your repo first.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
